  "description": "Phantom is where you buy, trade, and hold crypto, all in one place. Trusted by 20M+ users across Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, and more.\n\nNew to crypto or deep in it, Phantom is built for how you actually move.\n\nCheck out our products like the built-in swapper, token chat, explore tab, and more. Explore the crypto ecosystem in a wallet that you can trust.\n\nIt\u2019s easy to get started. Create an account with your email, fund your wallet, and start trading in seconds.\n\nBuy, Sell, Trade, and Manage Crypto\n- Buy Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, and thousands of tokens\n- Swap across multiple chains: Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Solana (SOL), Polygon (POL), Base, and HyperEVM (HYPE)\n- Make on-chain swaps with ease in a simple UI\n- Explore trending tokens and follow top traders\u2019 wallets\n- Stake your SOL with a couple taps\n\nSecurity You Can Trust\n- Stay secure with biometric authentication\n- Self-custody wallet \u2014 your keys, your crypto\n- Self-custodial wallet means you control your funds\n- Independently audited\n- 24/7 global support\n\nExplore\n- Discover and track trending tokens across categories like AI, Majors, and Top Volume\n- Follow top traders' wallets and spot moves early\n- Stay up to date with real-time earnings and market events\n- Hop into the token chat to catch the conversation and watch live trades\n\nPhantom Cash\n- Send and receive money instantly\n- Swap crypto to cash with no fees on stablecoins\n- Move money fast",
